Subject: [Saphira] Linux 7.3: iops->create() without flag arg (2.4.4 port)

Ports robn/zfs@d01c2c7fdef8 onto OpenZFS 2.4.4: the new autoconf test is
appended to the existing kernel-inode-create.m4 (2.4.4 already ships one
for the 6.3 idmap change), registered in kernel.m4 like upstream, the
decision checks no-flag FIRST so the old chain never errors on 7.3, and
